                "reply_count": 305,
                "retweet_count": 39,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I voted AGAINST the budget \u201cdeal\u201d because it fails to lower health care costs, extend ACA tax credits, or deliver for New Mexico.\n \nI won\u2019t stop working to make health care more affordable for working families. New Mexicans have been clear: keep fighting for us.\n \nPresident Trump and Republicans are gutting health care for kids and families, cutting food assistance, and pushing rural hospitals and grocery stores to the brink. They are helping the wealthiest while leaving everyday Americans behind.\n \nI will always put New Mexicans first.",
