                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Republican lawmakers have made it clear: they\u2019re willing to let Americans\u2019 health care costs skyrocket. Democrats are the only ones putting real solutions on the table to prevent that from happening. \n \nThis is about affordability \u2013 and it\u2019s past time that Republicans join us in extending the ACA tax credits.",
