                "retweet_count": 12,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "We\u2019re days away from ACA tax credits expiring, resulting in skyrocketing health care costs. Republican lawmakers are choosing to do nothing about the affordability crisis they created.\n\nThis isn\u2019t a red or blue issue \u2014 it\u2019s about making sure hardworking families can afford the care they need. I urge Republicans to join @SenateDems in fighting for Americans' access to affordable health care.",
